# OAC Link Hub — Agent Guidelines

Refer to `llms.txt` for canonical directives.

- **Permitted Scope**: Only modify `src/data/links.ts` and `public/images/`.
- **UI Lock**: Do not modify styling, animations, or components in `src/components/` or `src/App.tsx`.
- **White-Label Policy**: Do not add studio credits to the web UI. Footer stays community-only ("Made with ❤️ by Odisha Anime Community").
- **Security**: Outbound URLs must use `https://`, `http://`, or `mailto:`.
- **Validation**: Always verify with `npm run build`.
